Description: Opens multilayer networks in MiRA, the browser-based multilayer
    network visualizer (<https://mira.ecomplab.com/>), and describes how they
    should look with composable functions for the layout, nodes, links and
    layers. Works with multilayer objects from the 'emln' package.
